cff-version: 1.2.0
title: halow-fullmac-liveness-artifact
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and the associated paper.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Control-plane liveness models, board experiment harness, and raw logs for the
  paper "When Recovery Breaks Sessions: Liveness Failures across Firmware, Host,
  and Android in Wi-Fi HaLow FullMAC Stacks". The three models are pure Python 3
  (standard library only) and regenerate, from a clean clone, the report tables
  reproduced in the paper.
